/**
 * The demo league's photos: 18 proof photos and 6 player avatars, all generated images
 * (not photographs of real people) from assets/demo. 2.1 MB of JPEG embedded as base64: proof
 * photos are 1200 px wide and avatars 256 px.
 *
 * They live in source because a Convex function can't read files from the repository, and Reset
 * Seed has to work on a fresh deployment with no manual upload step. convex/seed.ts stores each
 * one in Convex file storage the first time it is missing and finds it again by its SHA-256.
 *
 * Generated by scripts/demo-assets/embed-seed-photos.mjs from assets/demo/manifest.json. Do not
 * edit it by hand: replace the file in assets/demo and run the script.
 */

